 "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のキャラクターを描いていただけないでしょうか！画像1を参考にしてください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LgDagAPR5-OQZLTiVqYljd8tDmrcyGS5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kanohaane/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c99157cc/uploads/origins/b503649f-d3b0-4bb4-804b-c04762a4d11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9607057fa6cdcdac92685221bc2f191f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c99157cc/uploads/origins/b503649f-d3b0-4bb4-804b-c04762a4d11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9607057fa6cdcdac92685221bc2f191f, https://si.imgix.net/c99157cc/uploads/origins/b503649f-d3b0-4bb4-804b-c04762a4d11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb13e2302c802fb9ee603d9414c0f9f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c99157cc/uploads/origins/b503649f-d3b0-4bb4-804b-c04762a4d11e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=661bbd801565baef525db81284474e23 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love the dreamy-like quality of your work! I would love if you could consider drawing my vtuber Miri who is a weather dragon. I would like you to draw her snowy weather form. I would like if the picture could capture the dream-like quality you have in your drawings! This picture would be used on social media (Twitter, Youtube, Twitch). I will leave pose and background up to you but please also provide a transparent background copy. Thank you so much for your consideration! Reference:\n https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15IsOaIZG89KL1XJeVXtAjY0v6xt9JchU?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kanohaane/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3e8bf704/uploads/origins/f0a7cdd4-b397-4e51-ab1f-00900d96d0aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63e4689951632d08d0845f9bcbf43df9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https: